WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:03.330
- Yes, but you've got
two hit "Frozen" movies.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:07.330
Will there be a third one, more than that?

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:08.410
I love this franchise. (laughs)

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:10.940
- Listen, even though--
- This is my "Star Wars".

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:14.860
- Even though I have zero authority

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.797
and no control, I would
like to formally announce

00:00:18.797 --> 00:00:20.631
"Frozen" 3, 4, and 5,

00:00:20.631 --> 00:00:21.500
(Kelly laughs)
and I just want Disney

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.690
to hear that,
(audience laughs and claps)

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:24.350
that I'll be showing up,

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.489
and I'll be in my groove,
(audience cheers)

00:00:26.489 --> 00:00:27.379
- Regardless!

00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:31.930
- Regardless of whether, so
let's do it, let's do it.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.119
- I have no power,
- I have--

00:00:33.119 --> 00:00:34.830
- But "Yes, it's happening."
- No control,

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:37.012
but I would like to
formally announce it, yeah.

00:00:37.012 --> 00:00:38.160
- (chuckles) All right, you
know what y'all should do, too?

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:39.790
They always do this
sometimes at Hollywood Bowl,

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:42.520
I feel like, where you don't even have to,

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.510
they stand behind mics

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:46.040
and everyone's acting out the characters--

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.080
- Yeah.
- You should do that.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.210
- We have talked about this because,

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:50.470
between the music from the first one

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:52.210
and the second one that
we all know and love,

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:54.250
and there's a couple
songs that had been cut

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.100
that no one's ever heard

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:55.933
from the first one
- Ooh!

00:00:55.933 --> 00:00:59.200
- And the second one, we've
been talking about maybe doing

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.310
a Hollywood Bowl, maybe televising it,

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:03.220
perhaps next year, with all of our--

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:04.700
- And perhaps,
- With Josh, and Jonathan,

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:05.980
and Idina--
- An invite is fine,

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:06.932
if you wanna

00:01:06.932 --> 00:01:08.038
invite me to attend
- Okay, got it, got it,

00:01:08.038 --> 00:01:09.070
got it, got it, yes.
- I can help.

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:11.330
I can wear all black and work the stage.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:12.740
- Amazing.
- I really

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:13.820
just wanna be there.
- (laughs) Okay.

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:15.730
- I love when they do that,
'cause everybody loves

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:17.380
the music, it's a big part of it.

